SupplierUI --> Settlement

AdminUI --> MarketplaceAPI
AdminUI --> Settlement
AdminUI --> Integrity
AdminUI --> Claims

MarketplaceAPI --> Eligibility
MarketplaceAPI --> Wallet
MarketplaceAPI --> SupplierHub
MarketplaceAPI --> Settlement
MarketplaceAPI --> OLTP

Eligibility --> Payer : eligibility / pre-auth
Claims --> Payer : claims / remittance / appeals
Wallet --> PSP : card / alternative payments
Settlement --> Bank : supplier payouts / treasury
SupplierHub --> SupplierNetwork : catalog / inventory / order sync
SupplierHub --> Courier : fulfillment / tracking

MarketplaceAPI --> Bus
Eligibility --> Bus
Wallet --> Bus
Claims --> Bus
SupplierHub --> Bus
Settlement --> Bus
